# Summary

The charter requires that each member pays a yearly contribution; the amount is fixed in the annex of the charter. [[cite:obs-f343c6891939d10d33883cb9356f97af17331b37 "Each member pays a yearly contribution; the amount is fixed in the annex of this charter."]]

The annex sets the ordinary contribution at one hundred twenty (120) EUR, payable within January. [[cite:obs-80f3c5a212f95c527d39f4218fe4f41ed0b69352 "Ordinary contributions: one hundred twenty (120) EUR, payable within January."]]
